@fact marisol.tides
# en: Teaches the tidecalling half of Evocation, waist-deep in the lake at dawn, and keeps the lake calm on exam days.
text [5356ef] = 教塑能术里唤潮的那一半，黎明时站在齐腰深的湖水里上课；考试那几天由她让湖面平静。

@fact marisol.poems
# en: She reads poems about water in the rain, under a dry patch of air, and never remembers their last lines.
text [936059] = 她在雨里、在一小片干燥的空气下读写水的诗，却从来记不住最后一行。
# en: Meet her at the Lakeshore.
hint [563091] = 在湖岸结识她。

@fact marisol.storms
# en: She goes out into the worst storms of the year on purpose. She says nobody learns tides on a calm day.
text [2d8f05] = 她专挑一年里最猛的暴风雨出门。她说风平浪静的日子里，谁也学不会潮汐。
# en: Visit the Lakeshore in autumn or spring, once she knows you well.
hint [02b5b0] = 等她熟悉你后，在秋天或春天去湖岸。

@fact marisol.margins
# en: She wrote her own tidecalling into the margins of a book of poems when she was a student, and still teaches from it.
text [2b7267] = 她还是学生时，把自己的唤潮术写在一本诗集的页边，至今仍照着它教。
# en: Keep visiting the Lakeshore until she trusts you.
hint [85230e] = 常去湖岸，直到她信任你。

@fact marisol.ice
# en: She stays in the lake when there is ice at the edges, and whoops like a child whenever a student's water rises.
text [922a9d] = 湖边结了冰她也照样待在湖里，学生的水一升起来，她就像孩子一样欢呼。
# en: Visit the Lakeshore in the evening.
hint [c68401] = 傍晚去湖岸。

@fact marisol.spirits
# en: She says the lake's water spirits always cheat, and that asking them nicely not to is the whole point of tidecalling.
text [e49b8e] = 她说湖里的水灵总是作弊，而客客气气地请它们别作弊，正是潮汐术的全部要义。
# en: Take Evocation.
hint [b224a2] = 选修塑能术。
